# Build context = what the image needs (package files, prisma, src). The image
# generates its own Prisma client: a local src/generated copied over it ran a
# client built from whatever schema the Mac last generated. Secrets, deps and
# the static site never belong in the context.
.git
.claude
node_modules
src/generated
.env
.env.*
app.env
state
state-e2e
site
demo
deploy
*.log
